"label": "Rationale: Portal Cliente as Presentation-Only Layer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El Portal del Cliente Ejecutivo no debe tener l\u00f3gica de negocio propia para crear procesos, finanzas o agendas; debe actuar como una capa de presentaci\u00f3n que consulta los dominios del Backoffice y restringe el acceso \u00fanicamente a la informaci\u00f3n del cliente autenticado, reutilizando los dominios ya existentes en vez de duplicar l\u00f3gica."}, {"id": "scrum_auth_decoupled_from_persona", "label": "Rationale: Decouple Auth System from Persona Entity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cuando el dominio Persona sea compartido por Personal, Cliente Ejecutivo y otros tipos de usuarios, conviene que el sistema de autenticaci\u00f3n sea independiente de la entidad Persona, manteniendo una tabla users donde el usuario es el n\u00famero de tel\u00e9fono (\u00fanico) relacionada a la persona correspondiente; as\u00ed, futuras autenticaciones (email, MFA, otros identificadores) solo requieren cambiar la l\u00f3gica de autenticaci\u00f3n, no el modelo de negocio, y facilita la integraci\u00f3n con Filament Shield."}, {"id": "scrum_qr_pago_pendiente_confirmacion", "label": "Rationale: QR Payments Registered as Pending Confirmation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mientras no exista integraci\u00f3n con la API del proveedor de pagos para confirmar autom\u00e1ticamente la transacci\u00f3n, el pago mediante QR quedar\u00e1 registrado como Pendiente de Confirmaci\u00f3n; la conciliaci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica con el dominio Finanzas queda definida como punto de extensi\u00f3n para una fase/sprint posterior."}], "edges": [{"source": "scrum_ep01_personas", "target": "scrum_consulta", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep02_personal_administrativo", "target": "scrum_personal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep03_clientes", "target": "scrum_cliente_ejecutivo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep04_procesos", "target": "scrum_proceso", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep05_finanzas", "target": "scrum_finanzas", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep06_documentos", "target": "scrum_documentos", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep07_portal_cliente", "target": "scrum_portal_cliente", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_ep08_seguridad", "target": "scrum_seguridad", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scrum_consulta", "target": "scrum_cliente_ejecutivo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scrum.txt", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "sc